OL,3,GNEWSAFloating home sought for buoyant
OL,4,Ariver boozer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who created a floating pub to
OL,7,Fserve drinks for his father's 60th
OL,8,Fbirthday has said he is hoping to find
OL,9,Fit a more permanent waterside home.
OL,11,FWill Bower built a buoyant boozer,
OL,12,Fdubbed The Float Inn, and took it down
OL,13,Fthe River Adur to celebrate his father
OL,14,FBill's birthday by serving drinks to
OL,15,Ffriends, family and passers-by.
OL,17,FBower, from Angmering in West Sussex,
OL,18,Fsaid he was keen for the pub to have a
OL,19,Fnew home either on the water or in
OL,20,Fsomeone's back garden.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
